14:43.186 --> 14:44.987
Hey, can we stop fucking around?

14:45.089 --> 14:46.587
What the fuck was that about?

14:47.764 --> 14:49.392
It's like why does
she care so much?

14:50.500 --> 14:51.326
She just doesn't like it

14:51.428 --> 14:52.566
when you don't
take her seriously enough.

14:52.668 --> 14:54.999
Shut up. You know what I mean!

14:55.101 --> 14:57.836
You know,
she's just like so intense.

14:57.938 --> 14:59.235
-Uh-huh.
-And she doesn't smile.

14:59.337 --> 15:02.304
