Are you serious?

15:21.429 --> 15:22.155
Yeah.

15:22.257 --> 15:23.626
Wait, like our Pauline?

15:23.728 --> 15:24.724
Uh-huh.

15:25.701 --> 15:28.398
No. I mean, it's probably not.

15:29.166 --> 15:31.703
-That's her. Uh...
-Okay.

15:31.805 --> 15:33.205
-Look. Go look.
-Okay.

15:36.205 --> 15:39.376
(BUS BRAKES SQUEALING)

15:41.714 --> 15:42.542
(HORN HONKING)

15:42.644 --> 15:44.951
It was her.
It was the fucking wedding DJ.

15:45.053 --> 15:47.184
-You're kidding!
-Are you sure it was heroin?

15:47.286 --> 15:48.921
