a playlist or something, no?

16:04.532 --> 16:06.539
MIKE: No.
You need a DJ, trust me.

16:06.641 --> 16:07.568
Who did yours again?

16:07.670 --> 16:09.274
-No one. It was a disaster.
-(CHARLIE CHUCKLES)

16:09.376 --> 16:10.870
Are you just afraid you're not
gonna find someone else?

16:10.972 --> 16:13.108
