or something.

16:34.598 --> 16:36.202
There was a whole bunch
of other crackheads.

16:36.304 --> 16:38.499
Why are you trying to be
her publicist all of a sudden?

16:38.602 --> 16:40.103
I don't know.
I just don't wanna dismiss her

16:40.205 --> 16:41.305
'cause of this one thing.
You know?

16:41.407 --> 16:44.804
Just checking in.
How was that mushroom risotto?

16:44.906 --> 16:46.680
-CHARLIE: It was so good.
-It was really, really good.

16:46.782 --> 16:47.948
-Yeah.
-COORDINATOR: Yeah?

16:48.051 --> 16:50.313
You need more time to think
or can we commit?

16:50.415 --> 16:51.918
-Do you wanna... Let's commit.
-EMMA: Yeah.

16:52.020 --> 16:53.719
-(CHARLIE AND EMMA LAUGH)
-RACHEL: Aw.

16:53.821 --> 16:55.189
Yes, we commit to it.

16:55.291 --> 16:56.319
CHARLIE: We'll commit to it.
COORDINATOR: Just so you know,

16:56.421 --> 16:59.621
it kinda has to be
final this time, so...

16:59.723 --> 17:01.895
Oh, yeah, yeah. Yeah,
we totally get it. Thank you.

17:01.997 --> 17:03.260
And, um, can I ask,
is there any way

17:03.362 --> 17:05.397
