of the skin contact?

17:05.499 --> 17:08.630
'Cause I haven't quite made
my mind up about the wine yet.

17:08.732 --> 17:10.737
-COORDINATOR: Okay.
-Yeah, me too, actually. Sorry.

17:10.839 --> 17:12.539
-Mike.
-(CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

17:12.641 --> 17:15.340
