17:17.139 --> 17:18.107
We're not a bar.

17:18.209 --> 17:19.539
-(CLINKING)
-RACHEL: Cheers!

17:19.641 --> 17:22.214
-(MIKE LAUGHS)
-RACHEL: Love you guys.

17:22.316 --> 17:24.278
You know, I barely touched
the food at our wedding.

17:24.381 --> 17:25.951
-Too much adrenaline.
-Yeah.

17:26.053 --> 17:27.248
And then
we ran around at 2:00 a.m.

17:27.350 --> 17:29.321
looking for a slice of pizza.

17:30.484 --> 17:32.089
We should go to the diner.

17:32.191 --> 17:34.489
-What, Andy's?
-EMMA: Yeah. Yeah.

17:34.591 --> 17:35.927
Yeah, and they're, like,
they're open late.

17:36.030 --> 17:37.930
Um, what, on our wedding night?

17:38.032 --> 17:39.264
-Andy's?
-EMMA: Yeah. It'll be fun.

17:39.366 --> 17:41.165
You know, like actors
when they win the Oscar

17:41.267 --> 17:42.464
and they, like,
go in their tuxes,

17:42.566 --> 17:44.396
and it's fancy,
and they order hamburgers.

17:44.498 --> 17:45.466
-Cute.
-EMMA: It's cool.

17:45.568 --> 17:47.573
Yeah. I mean, like...
Yeah. Maybe.

17:47.675 --> 17:48.636
(BOTH LAUGH)

17:48.738 --> 17:50.007
Don't they actually sell crack
out of that place?

17:50.109 --> 17:51.175
CHARLIE: Yes. That reminds me,

17:51.277 --> 17:53.780
what are we gonna
do about DJ Overdose?

17:53.883 --> 17:55.113
EMMA: Don't be mean.
MIKE: No.

17:55.215 --> 17:57.247
Just replace her.
It can't be that hard.

17:57.349 --> 17:58.612
This wouldn't
even be a conversation

17:58.714 --> 18:00.516
if we hadn't, like,
randomly seen her today.

18:00.618 --> 18:03.419
Yeah, but we did, and now
I'm gonna fixate over it.

18:03.522 --> 18:05.420
EMMA: Okay, but that's
a you problem though.

18:05.522 --> 18:07.354
Okay, what if
she was a pedophile?

18:07.457 --> 18:09.355
-EMMA: (SCOFFS) What?
-Mike.

18:09.457 --> 18:10.591
-EMMA: What?
-(WHEEZES)

18:10.693 --> 18:13.132
MIKE: What would it take
for you to fire her?

18:13.234 --> 18:15.100
-CHARLIE: Okay.
-Really fucking different,

18:15.202 --> 18:18.633
I feel like,
from doing drugs, right?

18:18.735 --> 18:20.599
-Like, that's...
-CHARLIE: Mike, everybody knows

18:20.701 --> 18:22.510
if you bring
a pedo to a wedding,

18:22.612 --> 18:23.505
it's just like...

18:23.608 --> 18:24.771
-It's bad vibes.
-RACHEL: Bad vibes all round.

18:24.873 --> 18:26.475
True. But a heroin addict,
on the other hand...

18:26.577 --> 18:28.345
-That could be great vibes.
-(EMMA CHUCKLES)

18:28.447 --> 18:30.247
-'Cause that's party vibes.
-Party vibes.

18:30.349 --> 18:31.846
-Exactly.
-It might be a little fun!

18:31.948 --> 18:35.716
For all we know, we could have
caught her on her worst day.

18:35.818 --> 18:37.753
Yeah, but you caught her.
Isn't that the point?

18:37.855 --> 18:40.054
Why are you acting like
you've never done anything bad?

18:40.156 --> 18:41.125
Not that bad.

18:41.227 --> 18:42.496
RACHEL:
What about the dog story?

18:42.598 --> 18:43.356
Hey, don't.

18:43.458 --> 18:45.499
(CHARLIE, EMMA CHUCKLE)

18:45.601 --> 18:46.362
CHARLIE: What?

18:46.464 --> 18:48.829
EMMA: Wow, okay.
What's the dog story?

18:50.034 --> 18:51.363
It's nothing.

18:51.465 --> 18:52.970
Just tell the story.

18:53.072 --> 18:55.336
No, I... Rachel, please.

18:55.438 --> 18:56.839
RACHEL: Before we got married,

18:56.941 --> 18:58.410
we did this thing where we said
the worst thing we've ever done.

18:58.512 --> 19:01.182
Yes, and then we said
we'd never speak about it again.

19:02.116 --> 19:03.316
-MIKE: Are you kidding me?
-Oh.

19:04.017 --> 19:06.187
-Just...
-(EMMA LAUGHS)

19:06.853 --> 19:07.881
It's fine.

19:09.352 --> 19:10.319
Do you want me to tell it?

19:10.421 --> 19:11.450
No, I don't want
anyone to tell it.

19:11.552 --> 19:13.056
-Wait...
-(EMMA SNICKERS)

19:13.158 --> 19:14.520
did you, like, fuck a dog?

19:14.622 --> 19:15.855
I didn't fuck a dog, Charlie.

19:15.957 --> 19:17.357
CHARLIE: I thought that's
what you were gonna say.

19:17.459 --> 19:19.096
Come on. I'll do mine too.

19:19.198 --> 19:20.261
(MIKE SIGHS IN EXASPERATION)

19:20.363 --> 19:21.730
(SOFTLY) Oh, fuck, man.

19:23.369 --> 19:26.268
Okay, I'll tell mine
if we all do it.

19:26.370 --> 19:27.435
-Great.
-CHARLIE: Sure.

19:27.537 --> 19:29.141
-Yeah? Promise?
-CHARLIE: Mm-hm.

19:29.243 --> 19:31.140
-RACHEL: Promise.
-(CHARLIE CHUCKLES)

19:31.242 --> 19:33.240
-Okay. What?
-Okay.

19:33.342 --> 19:34.411
